<title>UK: Salomon sets call warrants on Bank basket.</title>
<headline>Salomon sets call warrants on Bank basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers International Limited has issued 10 million European-style call warrants on a basket of European bank shares, lead manager Salomon Brothers said.</p>
<p>The basket consists of shares of Commerzbank AG, Deutsche Bank AG, Dresdner Bank AG, CS Group, SBC and UBS. One basket is controlled by 750 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    10,090 CHF		PREMIUM	19.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.86 CHF		  GEARING	6.89 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   19.MAR.99		 PAYDATE	18.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   ZURICH		    MIN EXER LOT 10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  9,610 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
